size_sweep_gap_2026-08-10.tsv       raw rows: round arm vec threads nlo ms_lo
                                    nhi ms_hi foreign_max
size_sweep_cells_2026-08-10.tsv     per-cell medians, bands, ratio, fits
size_sweep_report_2026-08-10.txt    the full printed report
